You now gain [8%, 11%, 13%, 15%, 16% (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind speed while Thought-Form: Bowman is active, [16, 22, 27, 30, 34 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Mindpower while Thought-Form: Warrior is active, and [5%, 7%, 8%, 9%, 10% (TL1-5; MP 100)] resist all while Thought-Form: Defender is active.

These bonuses scale with your Mindpower.
